<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola off focus list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola off focus list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it removed Motorola Inc from its focus list, but maintained a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The shares eased 5/8 to 62-5/8.</p>
</text>
